Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.46,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs73}Ghost Meets Gal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.52,0:00:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♬La, la, la♬...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♬La, la, la♬...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.86,0:00:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hit the high notes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.30,0:00:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♬La, la, la♬...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,These problems take a while if\Nyou solve them the usual way, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.50,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sleepy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Lubna. Can you solve this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H16151B&\\3c&HC896B3&\pos(994,501)\4c&H7473F9&\2c&HD6680A&}Miss Petie\NSmall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! M-M-Me? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Istilldon'tgetit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.94,0:00:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an advanced problem,\Nso it might be a little tricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How about Santhi,\Nwho's sitting next to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.52,0:00:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.90,0:01:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,65535, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.36,0:01:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Santhi's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm hopeless.\NThough I already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.72,0:01:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sleep.\NMaybe I'll go for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.68,0:01:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be my first time\Ncoming to the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.30,0:01:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'm really okay like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.10,0:01:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Can someone like me really become an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, a lost little lamb.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say it's proper to be\Nwandering around at this hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to my world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:51.20,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}Looking down, sighing, \Nhiding my true feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.65,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}Every time i step forward, \Neven if i'm trembling,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.86,0:01:56.50,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}I can't lie to my desire of change!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.30,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}It's surely a distant dream right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:01.79,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}but i want to chase it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:05.16,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}Even if our futures are different colors,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.45,0:02:08.18,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}Let's paint them with the same dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.54,0:02:12.70,Ghost meets gal; titulo e encerramento,,0,0,0,,{\c&HBF71B8&\2c&H3DB8FB&\3c&H00FFFF&\4c&H7473F9&\fs60}Because you are the one who gives me courage!
